  message: "Implemented position-aware access_mode classification. Two root causes fixed: (1) build_node_type_map() collapsed positional YAML rules into single mode — added build_positional_map() with byte-range child classification, (2) returns YAML section was silently dropped — now loaded. Python AST path reclassifies call edges on assignment lines as read. All 20 language YAML files benefit automatically (tree-sitter path). PR pending merge."  # 73c8
